<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115242" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῶσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>heaping up,</i> esp. of earth, <i>raising a mound</i> or
				<i>bank,</i> esp. against a city, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.76
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>filling up, blocking by carth thrown in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. τῶν λιμένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάφρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					5.41
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>embanking,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ θεάτρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					9(2).522.26
				</span></i>
			 (Larissa, <span class="entity">iii/ii B. C.</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
